    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPresented in immaculate, turnkey condition, this three bedroom end-of-terrace home in the highly sought-after Bellevue Rise development offers contemporary living at its finest. Less than a year old, the property combines the benefits of a virtually new home with top quality floor finishes throughout, allowing its new owners to move straight in and enjoy. \n\nDesigned with modern family living in mind, the bright and spacious accommodation is finished to an excellent standard throughout. \n\nThe living room is to the front of the house and gives access through double doors into the open plan kitchen/dining this is a wonderful bright space for both everyday living and entertaining. A spacious utility and guest wc and separate storage closet are located off the kitchen.\n\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom en suite along with a family bathroom. \n\nBoasting an impressive A2 BER rating, this energy-efficient home benefits from excellent insulation, air to water heating and lower running costs, ensuring year-round comfort and sustainability.\n\nBellevue Rise is an attractive, family-friendly development ideally located in the charming village of Delgany, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday amenities nearby. The nearby towns of Greystones and Bray offer an even wider range of shopping, leisure and recreational facilities, while excellent transport links, including the N11/M50 corridor, bus services and DART connections from Greystones, make commuting to Dublin both convenient and straightforward.\n\nCobblelock off street parking area for two cars. Gated side access to rear garden. Sunny west facing aspect with patio area for outdoor furniture and steps up to large lawn area. Fenced on all sides. Outside tap.\n\nThis is a perfect opportunity to acquire an almost-new, energy-efficient home in one of County Wicklow's most desirable residential locations, complete with premium finishes and a sunny west-facing garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - \nTiled flooring\n\nLiving Room - \nTiled flooring, central light, window to front, double doors to …\n\nKitchen/Dining - \nTiled flooring, recessed lighting in kitchen and two pendant lights, window to side and rear. Modern kitchen units, Electrolux fridge freezer, Electrolux dishwasher. Neff induction hob, quartz worktops. Window overlooking rear garden. Door to …\n\nUtility Room - \nTiled floor, fitted storage, central light, plumbed for washing machine, dryer, door to rear garden.\n\nGuest WC - \nTiled floor, recessed lighting, tiled walls, Villeroy & Bock sink and understorage, heated wall mirror, wc.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - \nLaminate flooring, attic access. Shelved storage closet.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nDouble room with laminate flooring, central light, fitted wardrobes, window to front.\n\nEn suite - \nTiled floor, recessed lighting, window to front, Villeroy & Boch whb with understorage, heated wall mirror, recessed lighting, wc, fully tiled around shower, heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nDouble room with laminate flooring, central light, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nLaminate flooring, spacious single room, window to rear, central light.\n\nBathroom - \nTiled floor, recessed lighting, fully tiled around bath, wall mounted towel rail, bath with Aqualla shower, Villeroy & Boch sink unit and understorage, window to side, part tiled walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
